anti-proliferative activity; 
no activity in MDA-MB-231 xenograft.

NanoBRET;
anti-proliferative activity; 
no activity in MDA-MB-231 xenograft.

IL-10-enhancing activities; 

YKL-05-099 leads to dose-dependent reduction in HDAC4 S246 phosphorylation and causes SOST down-regulation and RANKL up-regulation in Ocy454 cells. Validation of cellular specificity
YKL-05-099 reduces production of several inflammatory cytokines including TNFα, IL-6, IL-12 in BMDCs. | 460 ± 110 nM

